<<if $JacksonSocial > 50>>
    Jackson Ward is your energetic and hyperactive friend who attends Preston Academy with you. You can always count on things to be interesting and exciting around him and, despite his lack of social awareness or disregard for personal space, you always find life a bit more exciting when he is around. He also has a habit of randomly stripping at every chance he gets, due to his general disdain for clothing. Though, for you, this may actually be an upside. <br>
    <br>
<<elseif $JacksonSocial > -10>>
    Jackson Ward is your hyperactive classmate at Preston Academy. The boy is a walking ball of energy that doesn’t understand social cues, personal space, or that normal kids don’t strip randomly and bare it all to strangers. He can constantly be found climbing something or testing the limits of what he can get away with. His love of freedom and hatred for clothes make him an interesting, if not extremely tiring, boy to be around. <br>
    <br>
<<else>>
    Jackson Ward is the most annoying and hyperactive boy in Preston. He is a walking ball of energy that makes your head hurt every time you hear him talk at 300 words per minute. He has no common sense, no respect for personal space, and will randomly strip and pull his dick out at every possible moment. You’d find him interesting if he wasn’t so annoying. <br>
    <br>
<</if>>

<<if $CompletedQuests.includes("Jackson: Empty LOt")>>
    Not long into your relationship, you learned that his distaste for clothing goes further than you imagined. You discovered that Jackson likes to sneak out after dark to the empty lot near his house and run around without clothes on, enjoying the open air on his skin without getting in trouble. While perhaps slightly dangerous, you do find the act very wholesome as he is just being true to who he is. <br>
    <br>
<</if>>

<<if $CompletedQuests.includes("Jackson: Sibling Dynamics")>>
    Jackson lives with his mother and father. You’ve learned that his mother is on the city council while his father is the curator at the local museum. His younger brother Theo also seems much more calm and “normal” compared to Jackson, which leads you to wonder how he came out so different. <br>
    <br>
<</if>>

